  <name>Gloopy</name>
  <summary>A scriptable, composition-as-code DAW</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Gloopy is a linear-arranger digital audio workstation driven end to end by an
      OSC + gRPC control API over a diff-friendly, version-controllable project format.
      It hosts VST3/LV2 plugins, features a bundled Surge XT synth, and runs headless
      for offline rendering and automation.
    </p>
